  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till Mission of Palestine 2013 - 2014</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Mission of Palestine 2013 - 2014 - PLO mission</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project support to Mission of Palestine in Stockholm. The support     aims at supporting the maintenance of the office through covering     running costs of the Mission of Palestine in Stockholm due to the     large budget deficit of the Palestinian Authority and Palestinian     National Fund PNF, who finance the Palestinian missions abroad.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projekt st&#xf6;d till Palestinska myndighetens representation i           Stockholm. St&#xf6;det &#xe4;r g&#xe5;r till st&#xf6;dja uppr&#xe4;tth&#xe5;llandet av              representationen genom att t&#xe4;cka en del av kostnaden f&#xf6;r driften av   kontoret i och med Palestinska myndighetens kraftiga budgetunderskott med p&#xe5;f&#xf6;ljande konsekvenser f&#xf6;r Palestinian National Fund som         finansierar de palestinska utlandsrepresentationerna.</narrative>
  </description>
